### PATCH doctor
PATCH {{host}}/api/doctors/{{id}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "William",
  "email": "william.hello@example.com"
}

### PUT doctor
PUT {{host}}/api/doctors/{{id}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "Michael",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "address": "30 Joe Doe Street, Chicago, IL 60601",
  "email": "michael.smith@example.com",
  "specialization": "Oncologists",
  "experience": "Senior"
}

### DELETE doctor
DELETE {{host}}/api/doctors/{{id}}